   "check": "B3 X = sum_n D_n*col_n, BY ONE COMPLETE EXACT EXPANSION.  The exact cofactors are paired with the EXACT columns, not with the primitive integer rescalings the emit helper writes -- with those the sum is a scaled variant of X (175,470 terms) and the identity is false",
