  },
  {
   "check": "C1 EVERY J50 GENERATOR IS z1-MONIC UP TO A CONSTANT.  For each of Bbar, Cbar, E38, E43, E45, E50 the coefficient of the top power of z1 is a nonzero RATIONAL CONSTANT, so its z1-degree equals its total degree: Bbar:6, Cbar:10, E38:12, E43:14, E45:15, E50:16",
